<translate>
==== SecondaryAnimMask ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the animation mask that will be applied to the animation when the item is in the secondary hand.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
SecondaryAnimMask = HoldingTorchLeft,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

